# Experiment Log

每个 attempt 结束立即追加，包含负结果、失败、阻塞、取消。

## Run ID / attempt / stage checkpoint
- claim / block / cycle:
- requested model / actual model / effort:
- command / code revision / config hash / seed:
- dataset / split / GT provenance / evaluation type:
- environment ledger / hardware:
- start / end / exit code / status:
- GPU hours / cost:
- raw JSON/CSV / stdout / stderr / checkpoint archive:
- baseline / audit / conclusion / next:
- hypothesis / claim ID / method revision / tested scope:
- planned vs completed valid runs / missing, failed, deferred runs & reasons:
- failure layer: implementation / protocol / method / hypothesis / unresolved:
- observed fact / interpretation / untested insight (separate):
- FAILURE_ANALYSIS insight ID / next discriminating test / later cycle link:
- conclusion status & limits / decisive-stop evidence or resource-stop reason:

## Revision / Context Handoff
每轮修订及压缩、切换、恢复时追加；引用原始契约/证据，不用摘要覆盖历史。
- cycle / stage / attempt / trusted checkpoint & commit:
- confirmed goal / non-goals / constraints / effective decision reference:
- source contract paths / revisions / hashes / current actual process & artifacts:
- this round changes / unchanged invariants / old→new revision / reason:
- semantic diff: goal / mechanism / claims / evaluation / conclusion strength / budget:
- affected novelty, design, reviews & approvals / revalidation result:
- contrary evidence / missing coverage / related failure & insight IDs:
- conflict, if any / preserved attempt / trusted baseline & validation to resume:
- next action / unresolved decisions / checkpoint reference:
